  CL8NK Entry: distributive_law_lambda
  The distributive law λ: PG → GP as the mixed distributive law mediating the power-set monad P (Cantor
  diagonalization) and Gödel encoding comonad G, with ⊙ as the fixed point of λ — the grammar's self-encoding formula
  g := Cantor ∘ Gödel realized categorically.
